WHAT THIS COVERS

  The original work here: index.html, room-3d.html and
  demos/portfolio-2d.html; the JavaScript written for them, including
  demos/portfolio-data.js, demos/portfolio-shared.js, demos/wall-layout.js
  and demos/room/; the Python in tools/; the written material in README.md
  and docs/; and the images and recordings made for this site --
  demos/models/avatar.jpg, badge.jpg, og.jpg, wall.jpg, wall-left.jpg,
  wall-right.jpg and the screen captures in demos/clips/.


WHAT YOU MAY DO WITHOUT ASKING

  Read the source, in this repository or in your browser.
  Quote short excerpts, with attribution and a link back.
  Link to the published site.


WHAT NEEDS PERMISSION

  Everything else -- in particular reusing the room, its layout or its code
  as the basis of another portfolio or product. Ask first.


